nd healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 18.", "(4) Set: When struck in combat has a 2% chance of shielding the wearer in a protective shield which will absorb 488 damage. Can only occur once every 60 sec.", "(5) Set: Your spellcasts have a 5% chance to energize you for 200 mana.", "(6) Set: Restores 8 mana per 5 sec."}, seen=false, p=11.1}, {id=16686, n="博学者头冠", nEn="Magister's Crown", q="q3", slot="头部", i="inv_crown_02", type="布甲", ilvl=62, req=57, st={"71 护甲", "+30 智力", "+10 耐力", "装备：+11 法术强度", "博学者的法衣（0/8）", "（2 件）套装：所有抗性 +8", "（3 件）套装：提高所有法术和魔法效果所造成的伤害和治疗效果，最多18点。", "（4 件）套装：在战斗中被击中时有2%的几率将攻击者冻结在原地，持续3秒。每60秒只能触发一次。", "（5 件）套装：你施法时有5%的几率为你恢复200点法力值。", "（6 件）套装：每5秒恢复8点法力值。"}, stEn={"71 Armor", "+30 Intellect", "+10 Stamina", "Equip: +11 Spell Power", "Magister's Regalia (0/8)", "(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.", "(3) Set: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 18.", "(4) Set: When struck in combat has a 2% chance of freezing the attacker in place for 3 sec. Can only occur once every 60 sec.", "(5) Set: Your spellcasts have a 5% chance to energize you for 200 mana.", "(6) Set: Restores 8 mana per 5 sec."}, seen=false, p=11.1}, {id=16698, n="鬼雾面具", nEn="Dreadmist Mask", q="q3", slot="头部", i="inv_helmet_29", type="布甲", ilvl=62, req=57, st={"71 护甲", "+23 智力", "+15 耐力", "+12 精神", "装备：+14 法术强度", "鬼雾法衣（0/8）", "（2 件）套装：所有抗性 +8", "（3 件）套装：提高所有法术和魔法效果所造成的伤害和治疗效果，最多18点。", "（4 件）套装：在战斗中被击中时有2%的几率使攻击者恐惧逃跑，持续2秒。每60秒只能触发一次。", "（5 件）套装：你施法时有5%的几率为你恢复270到330点生命值。", "（6 件）套装：每5秒恢复8点法力值。"}, stEn={"71 Armor", "+23 Intellect", "+15 Stamina", "+12 Spirit", "Equip: +14 Spell Power", "Dreadmist Raiment (0/8)", "(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.", "(3) Set: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 18.", "(4) Set: When struck in combat has a 2% chance of causing the attacker to flee in terror for 2 sec. Can only occur once every 60 sec.", "(5) Set: Your spellcasts have a 5% chance to heal you for 270 to 330.", "(6) Set: Restores 8 mana per 5 sec."}, seen=false, p=11.1}, {id=16707, n="迅影罩帽", nEn="Shadowcraft Cap", q="q3", slot="头部", i="inv_helmet_41", type="皮甲", ilvl=62, req=57, st={"141 护甲", "+20 敏捷", "+20 耐力", "+6 力量", "+13 精神", "迅影护甲（0/8）", "（2 件）套装：所有抗性 +8", "（3 件）套装：攻击强度 +30", "（4 件）套装：在战斗中被击中时有5%的几率解除你身上的诱捕效果。每60秒只能触发一次。", "（5 件）套装：近战攻击时有一定几率恢复20点能量。", "（6 件）套装：每5秒恢复15点生命值。"}, stEn={"141 Armor", "+20 Agility", "+20 Stamina", "+6 Strength", "+13 Spirit", "Shadowcraft Armor (0/8)", "(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.", "(3) Set: +30 Attack Power.", "(4) Set: When struck in combat, has a 5% chance to remove a Snare effect from yourself. Can only occur once every 60 sec.", "(5) Set: Chance on melee attack to restore 20 Energy.", "(6) Set: Restores 15 health per 5 sec."}, seen=false, p=11.1}, {id=16720, n="野性之心兜帽", nEn="Wildheart Cowl", q="q3", slot="头部", i="inv_helmet_27", type="皮甲", ilvl=62, req=57, st={"141 护甲", "+20 智力", "+20 精神", "+10 耐力", "+6 力量", "装备：+15 治疗", "装备：+5 法术伤害", "野性之心法衣（0/8）", "（2 件）套装：所有抗性 +8", "（3 件）套装：提高所有法术和魔法效果所造成的伤害和治疗效果，最多18点。", "（3 件）套装：攻击强度 +30", "（4 件）套装：在战斗中被击中时有5%的几率使你的移动速度提高10%，持续8秒。每60秒只能触发一次。", "（5 件）套装：施法时有一定几率恢复200点法力值，近战攻击时有一定几率在5秒内恢复20点能量，被近战攻击击中时有一定几率获得10点怒气。", "（6 件）套装：每5秒恢复8点法力值。"}, stEn={"141 Armor", "+20 Intellect", "+20 Spirit", "+10 Stamina", "+6 Strength", "Equip: +15 Healing", "Equip: +5 Spell Damage", "Wildheart Raiment (0/8)", "(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.", "(3) Set: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 18.", "(3) Set: +30 Attack Power.", "(4) Set: When struck in combat, has a 5% chance to increase your movement speed by 10% for 8 sec. Can only occur once every 60 sec.", "(5) Set: Chance on spellcast to restore 200 Mana, on melee attack to regenerate 20 Energy over 5 sec, and when struck by a melee attack to generate 10 Rage.", "(6) Set: Restores 8 mana per 5 sec."}, seen=false, p=11.1}, {id=16677, n="野兽追猎者之帽", nEn="Beaststalker's Cap", q="q3", slot="头部", i="inv_helmet_24", type="锁甲", ilvl=62, req=57,