+8", "（3 件）套装：提高所有法术和魔法效果所造成的伤害和治疗效果，最多18点。", "（4 件）套装：在战斗中被击中时有2%的几率将攻击者冻结在原地，持续3秒。每60秒只能触发一次。", "（5 件）套装：你施法时有5%的几率为你恢复200点法力值。", "（6 件）套装：每5秒恢复8点法力值。"}, stEn={"46 Armor", "+21 Intellect", "+6 Stamina", "Equip: +7 Spell Power", "Equip: +1 Spell Penetration", "Magister's Regalia (0/8)", "(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.", "(3) Set: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 18.", "(4) Set: When struck in combat has a 2% chance of freezing the attacker in place for 3 sec. Can only occur once every 60 sec.", "(5) Set: Your spellcasts have a 5% chance to energize you for 200 mana.", "(6) Set: Restores 8 mana per 5 sec."}, seen=false, p=3.0}, {id=16702, n="鬼雾腰带", nEn="Dreadmist Belt", q="q3", slot="腰部", i="inv_belt_12", type="布甲", ilvl=58, req=53, st={"46 护甲", "+14 智力", "+10 耐力", "+9 精神", "装备：+9 法术强度", "装备：法术穿透 +1", "鬼雾法衣（0/8）", "（2 件）套装：所有抗性 +8", "（3 件）套装：提高所有法术和魔法效果所造成的伤害和治疗效果，最多18点。", "（4 件）套装：在战斗中被击中时有2%的几率使攻击者恐惧逃跑，持续2秒。每60秒只能触发一次。", "（5 件）套装：你施法时有5%的几率为你恢复270到330点生命值。", "（6 件）套装：每5秒恢复8点法力值。"}, stEn={"46 Armor", "+14 Intellect", "+10 Stamina", "+9 Spirit", "Equip: +9 Spell Power", "Equip: +1 Spell Penetration", "Dreadmist Raiment (0/8)", "(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.", "(3) Set: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 18.", "(4) Set: When struck in combat has a 2% chance of causing the attacker to flee in terror for 2 sec. Can only occur once every 60 sec.", "(5) Set: Your spellcasts have a 5% chance to heal you for 270 to 330.", "(6) Set: Restores 8 mana per 5 sec."}, seen=false, p=1.0}, {id=16710, n="迅影护腕", nEn="Shadowcraft Bracers", q="q3", slot="手腕", i="inv_bracer_07", type="皮甲", ilvl=57, req=52, st={"71 护甲", "+15 敏捷", "+7 耐力", "迅影护甲（0/8）", "（2 件）套装：所有抗性 +8", "（3 件）套装：攻击强度 +30", "（4 件）套装：在战斗中被击中时有5%的几率解除你身上的诱捕效果。每60秒只能触发一次。", "（5 件）套装：近战攻击时有一定几率恢复20点能量。", "（6 件）套装：每5秒恢复15点生命值。"}, stEn={"71 Armor", "+15 Agility", "+7 Stamina", "Shadowcraft Armor (0/8)", "(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.", "(3) Set: +30 Attac